.TH WIFI-HOTSPOT-SETTINGS 1 "2026-10-29" "RelayForge 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wifi-hotspot-settings \- open the RelayForge Wi\-Fi sharing settings window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wifi-hotspot-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wifi-hotspot-settings
launches the GTK settings window for RelayForge (the Wi\-Fi Relay service).
It communicates with the system D\-Bus service
.I io.github.erhanzeyrek.WifiHotspot
to read and change the hotspot configuration and to start or stop sharing.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wifi-hotspot-tray (1),
.BR relayforge-service (8)
